      "content": "SP 81 SE             WESTON TURVILLE         TRING ROAD (A41) 5/338                                        Barn at Broughton Farm 26/1/77 GV                                           II Barn. C18. Timber framed on brick plinth, weatherboarded, roof formerly tiled now protected with polythene sheeting. Gabled cart entries flanked by outshots. Interior: 6 bays with braced tiebeams, queenstrut trusses, curved windbraces. Listing NGR: SP8506313024"
